#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:5
#: a8a365d25cb245729a034a5460788d2e
msgid "Multiple Vehicles with MAVProxy"
msgstr "MAVProxy 多机操作"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:7
#: 7ac48b9d513b4ba69008779af178167f
msgid "MAVProxy has support for multi-vehicle operations."
msgstr "MAVProxy 支持多机操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:11
#: a19b42dae1624149a455470f80cd0d37
msgid ""
"To use this feature, ensure all vehicles (real or SITL) have different "
"SYSID_THISMAV parameter values. Use ``param set SYSID_THISMAV X`` to set "
"this value in the MAVProxy console (where ``X`` is the id)."
msgstr ""
"若要使用此功能，请确保所有飞行器（真实或 SITL）的 SYSID_THISMAV 参数值各不相同。在 MAVProxy 控制台中使用 ``param "
"set SYSID_THISMAV X`` 设置该值（其中 ``X`` 为飞行器 ID）。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:13
#: 6397479fdf274380aff42c87acaefea0
msgid ""
"Most MAVProxy modules are designed to talk to only 1 vehicle at a time. This"
" is the active vehicle. To change which vehicle is active, use the Vehicle "
"dropdown menu on the graphical console. All modules will then send any "
"relevant commands to that vehicle only."
msgstr ""
"大多数 MAVProxy 模块每次只能与 1 架飞行器通信，即当前活动飞行器。若要切换活动飞行器，请使用图形控制台上的 Vehicle "
"下拉菜单。之后所有模块仅向该飞行器发送相关命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:15
#: b54c66ccd0c64d349dddea4fb552549b
msgid "In the terminal, there are two options available:"
msgstr "在终端中，有两个可用选项："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:17
#: 68f73e484c88443ba99be43b4840b0a5
msgid ""
"Use ``alllinks <cmd>`` to send <cmd> to all vehicles in turn. For example, "
"``alllinks mode rtl`` will set RTL mode on all vehicles."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``alllinks <cmd>`` 依次向所有飞行器发送命令 <cmd>。例如，``alllinks mode rtl`` 将为所有飞行器设置 "
"RTL 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:18
#: 4e956c7d257d4b79a81fa77dcfc76441
msgid "Use ``vehicle <n>`` to set the active vehicle"
msgstr "使用 ``vehicle <n>`` 设置当前活动飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/multi.rst:20
#: 6034b460605745519b3f350e304a84bd
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`swarm module <mavproxy-modules-swarm>` for a GUI for "
"automating swarm management and operations."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`swarm 模块 <mavproxy-modules-swarm>`，了解用于自动化集群管理和操作的图形界面。"
